A data type that defines a fixed set of named values (like enum Color { Red, Green, Blue }), enabling type-safe representation of discrete choices.

A **data type** that defines a fixed set of named values (like `enum Color { Red, Green, Blue }`), enabling type-safe representation of discrete choices.
